{
  "_about": "People of the village. talk: the first rule whose condition is true gives the dialogue. when: the person is on the map only when the condition is true. nameKey: the name of the person (the people of Phù Đổng keep a name of work and kinship, as Bác thợ rèn). kin, order, age, child, and name: the person is called by a word of kinship to the child and a word after it, by the way of naming of the region and the age of the person (data/world/naming.json, src/core/naming.js): the order of birth in the family (cô Năm, #38), the name of the first child (ông Dương, #41), or the own small name (chị Hến, #41). age: elder, grown, or young; child: the name of the first child; name: the own small name. folk: a child of a folk game (loco or rope, docs/FOLKGAMES.md): the game puts the child near its court or rope, not the map.",
